                                                "sense_id": "7af2d953-1972-372a-83c0-be867a1d5b0a",
                                                "text": "“Leave the ivory!” he cried. “Leave the ivory! Dead men have no use for ivory!” Some of the Manyuema started to lay down their loads, but this was altogether too much for the avaricious Arabs."
