                                                "sense_id": "2608876a-11cc-30d0-b209-050912b1926d",
                                                "text": "c. 1846, Alexandre Dumas (translated by William Barrow), The Three Musketeers\nThe triumphant Englishman did not give himself the trouble even to shake the dice; and, so sure was he of winning, that he threw the ivory on the table without looking."
